This is an implementation of the Berman 1988 internally consistent database of
minerals of the system Na2O-K2O-CaO-MgO-FeO-Fe2O3-Al2O3-SiO2-TiO2-H2O-CO2,
Journal of Petrology, Vol. 29, Part 2, pp. 445-522, 1988. 

Note: This dataset is for solids minerals only. No liquid model is included.
Also note that the solid minerals of the Berman & Brown 1984 and Berman 1983
models (which _do_ include a liquid phase model) are not exactly the same as
those here. So before one uses the liquid model of BB84 or B83 with the B88
minerals, one should slightly rescale them.

Note: This database is also used for the Ghiorso & Sack 1995 model, as well
as other models in the literature.

